{"suttaId":"tha-ap208","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7511,7526],"vripara":"25"},"segments":{"tha-ap208:0.3":"Udakadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap208:1.1":"“Bhuñjantaṃ samaṇaṃ disvā, vippasannamanāvilaṃ;","tha-ap208:1.3":"Ghaṭenodakamādāya, siddhatthassa adāsahaṃ.","tha-ap208:2.1":"“Nimmalo homahaṃ ajja, vimalo khīṇasaṃsayo;","tha-ap208:2.3":"Bhave nibbattamānamhi, phalaṃ nibbattate mama [subhaṃ (sī.)].","tha-ap208:3.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, udakaṃ yamadāsahaṃ [yaṃ tadā adaṃ (sī.), adadiṃ tadā (syā.)];","tha-ap208:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, dakadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap208:4.1":"“Ekasaṭṭhimhito kappe, ekova vimalo ahu;","tha-ap208:4.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap208:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap208:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā udakadāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap208:7.1":"Udakadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
